c=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r189.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＞<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r190.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r191.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\">x＋2＞8－x<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r192.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\">x＞3<br>又<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r193.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＋<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r194.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＞<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r195.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r196.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\">2＋（8－x）＞x<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r197.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\">x＜5<br>∴3＜x＜5","k":["101年基測"],"d":"易","html":1},{"id":"05800771","s":"如圖，一圓桌周圍有20個箱子，依順時針方向編號1～20。小明在1號箱子中丟入一顆紅球後，沿著圓桌依順時針方向行走，每經過一個箱子就依下列規則丟入一顆球：<br>1.若前一個箱子丟紅球，經過的箱子就丟綠球。<br>2.若前一個箱子丟綠球，經過的箱子就丟白球。<br>3.若前一個箱子丟白球，經過的箱子就丟紅球。<br>已知他沿著圓桌走了100圈，求4號箱內有幾顆紅球？【101年基測】<br><img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_image37.png\" width=\"130\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["33","34","99","100"],"a":1,"e":"依規則可知：丟球順序為紅、綠、白（3個一循環）<br>100÷3＝33……1<br>第4號箱內有33＋1＝34顆紅球","k":["101年基測"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05800772","s":"如圖，梯形ABCD中，∠DAB＝∠ABC＝90°，E點在<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r199.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">上，且<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r200.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r201.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝1：4。若<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r202.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝5，<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r203.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝4，<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r204.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">＝8，則四邊形ABCE的面積為何？【101年基測】<br><img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_image38.png\" width=\"118\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["24","25","26","27"],"a":2,"e":"連接<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r206.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>梯形ABCD面積＝<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r207.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">×（8＋4）×5＝30<br>△ABC面積＝<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r208.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">×5×4＝10<br>△ACD面積＝梯形ABCD面積－△ABC面積<br>＝30－10＝20<br>△ADE面積：△ACE面積＝<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r209.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r210.svg\