th=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">＝3，則小正方形的邊長為何？【101年基測】<br><img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_image41.png\" width=\"98\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r230.svg\" width=\"31\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r231.svg\" width=\"22\" alt=\"附圖\">","5","6"],"a":1,"e":"∵∠1＋∠2＝90°，∠2＋∠3＝90°　∴∠1＝∠3<br>在△BEF與△CFD中<br>∵∠1＝∠3，∠B＝∠C＝90°<br>∴△BEF～△CFD（AA相似）<br><img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r232.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\"><img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r233.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r234.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r235.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r236.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r237.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\"><img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r238.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r239.svg\" width=\"64\" alt=\"附圖\">＝3：12<br><img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r240.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\"><img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r241.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">：15＝1：4<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r242.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\"><img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r243.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r244.svg\" width=\"22\" alt=\"附圖\"><br><img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_image42.png\" width=\"98\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["101年基測"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05800776","s":"如圖，直角三角形ABC有一外接圓，其中∠B＝90°，<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r246.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">＞<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r247.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">，今欲在<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r248.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">上找一點P，使得<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r249.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r250.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">，以下是甲、乙兩人的作法：<br>(甲)1.取<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r251.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">中點D<br>2.過D作直線AC的平行線，交<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r252.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">於P，則P即為所求<br>(乙)1.取<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r253.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">中點E<br>2.過E作直線AB的平行線，交<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r254.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">於P，則P即為所求<br>對於甲、乙兩人的作法，下列判斷何者正確？【101年基測】<br><img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_image43.png\" width=\"82\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["兩人皆正確","兩人皆錯誤","甲正確，乙錯誤","甲錯誤，乙正確"],"a":3,"e":"甲：如圖(一)<br>∵<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r256.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">//<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r257.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">，且D為<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r258.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">中點<br>∴E為<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r259.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">中點<br>但<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r260.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">沒有垂直<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r261.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">　∴<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r262.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">≠<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r263.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\"><br><img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_image44.png\" width=\"82\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>圖(一)<br>乙：如圖(二)<br>∵∠B＝90°　∴<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r265.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">為圓的直徑<br>又E為<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r266.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">中點，即為圓的圓心<br>∵<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r267.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">//<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r268.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">　∴<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r269.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">⊥<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r270.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>且<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r271.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r272.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">，故<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r273.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r274.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\"><br><img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_image45.png\" width=\"82\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>圖(二)","k":["101年基測"],"d":"難","html":1},{"id":"05800777","s":"圖(一)的長方形ABCD中，E點在<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r276.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">上，且<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r277.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝2<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r278.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">。今分別以<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r279.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">、<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r280.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">為摺線，將A、D向<img src=\"img/7c9caf_y101_r281.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">方向